ges.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tulam--flin-flower10343.jpg' alt='baskauf/10343'></a><figcaption>baskauf/10343<br>Ulmus americana<br>inflorescence · mid-range · cos 0.80</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tacru--wpin-flower50750.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tacru--wpin-flower50750.jpg' alt='baskauf/50750'></a><figcaption>baskauf/50750<br>Acer rubrum<br>whole tree · distant · cos 0.78</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tacru--fldistant00000.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tacru--fldistant00000.jpg' alt='baskauf/00000'></a><figcaption>baskauf/00000<br>Acer rubrum<br>inflorescence · distant · cos 0.78</figcaption></figure></div><h4>PC1 -2SD</h4><div class=strip><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tzaam--lfpetiole-lower35728.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tzaam--lfpetiole-lower35728.jpg' alt='baskauf/35728'></a><figcaption>baskauf/35728<br>Zanthoxylum americanum<br>leaf · close-up · cos 0.76</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tploc--tw15360.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tploc--tw15360.jpg' alt='baskauf/15360'></a><figcaption>baskauf/15360<br>Platanus occidentalis<br>twig · mid-range · cos 0.73</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tqubi--lf12366.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tqubi--lf12366.jpg' alt='baskauf/12366'></a><figcaption>baskauf/12366<br>Quercus bicolor<br>leaf · close-up · cos 0.73</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tacru--lf11920.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tacru--lf11920.jpg' alt='baskauf/11920'></a><figcaption>baskauf/11920<br>Acer rubrum<br>leaf · close-up · cos 0.72</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tfram2-lf12465.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tfram2-lf12465.jpg' alt='baskauf/12465'></a><figcaption>baskauf/12465<br>Fraxinus americana<br>leaf · close-up · cos 0.72</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tcaca18lfbase15696.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tcaca18lfbase15696.jpg' alt='baskauf/15696'></a><figcaption>baskauf/15696<br>Carpinus caroliniana<br>leaf · close-up · cos 0.71</figcaption></figure></div><h4>PC1 +2SD</h4><div class=strip><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tprse2-flin-flower10643.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tprse2-flin-flower10643.jpg' alt='baskauf/10643'></a><figcaption>baskauf/10643<br>Prunus serotina<br>whole tree · distant · cos 0.77</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/t89397.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/t89397.jpg' alt='baskauf/89397'></a><figcaption>baskauf/89397<br>Pinus strobus<br>whole tree · distant · cos 0.77</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/t91107.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/t91107.jpg' alt='baskauf/91107'></a><figcaption>baskauf/91107<br>Ulmus americana<br>whole tree · distant · cos 0.76</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tquma2-wplarge12413.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tquma2-wplarge12413.jpg' alt='baskauf/12413'></a><figcaption>baskauf/12413<br>Quercus macrocarpa<br>whole tree · distant · cos 0.76</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/t91011.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/t91011.jpg' alt='baskauf/91011'></a><figcaption>baskauf/91011<br>Acer rubrum<br>whole tree · distant · cos 0.75</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/t90911.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/t90911.jpg' alt='baskauf/90911'></a><figcaption>baskauf/90911<br>Platanus occidentalis<br>whole tree · distant · cos 0.74</figcaption></figure></div></dd><dt>能说明什么</dt><dd>簇中心的近邻平均有 6.0/6 张属于该簇，主导器官占比 90%，高于簇整体的 82%：检索出的是该簇的“典型”图片（会夸大簇的纯度，展示时需注意）。PC1 −2SD → 近景叶片，+2SD → 远景整树，与第 5 项一致。这是检索，不是图像生成。</dd></dl></section><section id=e8><h2>附：同样的纯向量实验在 BioCLIP 2.5 和 DINOv3 上的结果</h2><div><span class='b v'>经验证结论</span></div><p>主实验跑完后，从 Drive 恢复了 BioCLIP 2.5（1,641 × 1,024）和 DINOv3（1,641 × 768）的原始向量，记录了 SHA-256，并核对了 image_id 顺序和 split 与 manifest 一致。第 1、4、5、6、7 项用 <code>FGV_MODEL=bioclip|dinov3</code> 原样重跑，结果在 results/bioclip/ 和 results/dinov3/。第 3 项仍需要 BioCLIP / DINOv3 的模型权重。NSC 的分组任务和检索使用各模型自己已有的 K=20 簇。熵对错误的 AUROC 只有 EfficientNet 有，因为其他模型的逐图预测不在 Git 中。</p><div class=tw><table><tr><th>model</th><th>2D 15-NN (all 1,641)</th><th>64D 15-NN (val)</th><th>d*</th><th>species probe F1 (val, full)</th><th>organ probe F1 (val, full)</th><th>NSC organ coords @1-SE</th><th>NSC organ F1 1-SE/Δ0</th><th>GMM max&lt;0.6</th><th>GMM seed ARI</th><th>entropy AUROC mid-range</th><th>PC1 ρ scale</th><th>PCA-32 test MSE (site)</th><th>linear AE / PCA</th><th>centroid top-6 dominant organ</th></tr><tr><td>BioCLIP 2.5</td><td>0.096</td><td>0.746</td><td>256</td><td>0.791</td><td>0.725</td><td>64</td><td>0.977</td><td>0.011</td><td>0.556</td><td>0.373</td><td>0.033</td><td>0.000284 (0.000284)</td><td>1.000</td><td>0.500</td></tr><tr><td>DINOv3</td><td>0.143</td><td>0.806</td><td>&gt;256</td><td>0.431</td><td>0.828</td><td>64</td><td>0.958</td><td>0.008</td><td>0.566</td><td>0.619</td><td>-0.506</td><td>0.000498 (0.000498)</td><td>1.000</td><td>0.908</td></tr><tr><td>EfficientNet-B0</td><td>0.125</td><td>0.759</td><td>&gt;256</td><td>0.101</td><td>0.649</td><td>22</td><td>0.971</td><td>0.013</td><td>0.657</td><td>0.639</td><td>-0.645</td><td>0.000296 (0.000296)</td><td>1.003</td><td>0.900</td></tr></table></div><h4>BioCLIP 2.5：PC1–3</h4><div class=tw><table><tr><th>pc</th><th>var</th><th>rho_scale_close</th><th>rho_brightness</th><th>reading</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>0.09</td><td>0.03</td><td>-0.00</td><td>no clear organ correlate (all |rho|&lt;0.2)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>0.05</td><td>0.12</td><td>-0.05</td><td>no clear organ correlate (all |rho|&lt;0.2)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>0.04</td><td>-0.45</td><td>0.34</td><td>low end ~ leaf, high end ~ whole tree</td></tr></table></div><h4>DINOv3：PC1–3</h4><div class=tw><table><tr><th>pc</th><th>var</th><th>rho_scale_close</th><th>rho_brightness</th><th>reading</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>0.09</td><td>-0.51</td><td>0.33</td><td>low end ~ leaf, high end ~ whole tree</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>0.06</td><td>-0.59</td><td>0.18</td><td>low end ~ bark, high end ~ whole tree</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>0.05</td><td>0.00</td><td>-0.10</td><td>low end ~ leaf, high end ~ inflorescence</td></tr></table></div><h4>EfficientNet-B0：PC1–3</h4><div class=tw><table><tr><th>pc</th><th>var</th><th>rho_scale_close</th><th>rho_brightness</th><th>reading</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>0.10</td><td>-0.65</td><td>0.33</td><td>low end ~ leaf, high end ~ whole tree</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>0.06</td><td>-0.44</td><td>0.11</td><td>low end ~ bark, high end ~ whole tree</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>0.05</td><td>-0.04</td><td>0.14</td><td>low end ~ inflorescence, high end ~ leaf</td></tr></table></div><p>解读：(1) 恢复的向量就是之前用的那批：三个模型的 PCA-32 test MSE 与网站上 AE 表的数值在 6 位小数上一致，线性 AE 与 PCA 吻合（比值≈1）。(2) 三个模型的 2D 都只保留 10–14% 的 15 近邻；只有 BioCLIP 在 256 维时满足 d* 规则。(3) 拍摄尺度轴在 EfficientNet（ρ=−0.65）和 DINOv3（ρ=−0.51）里是 PC1，在 BioCLIP 里到 PC3 才出现（ρ=−0.45；PC1–2 的 |ρ|≤0.12），与 BioCLIP 以物种为先一致。(4) NSC 只在 EfficientNet 上能把器官任务稀疏化（22/64 个坐标）；BioCLIP 和 DINOv3 的器官信息分散在全部 64 个主成分上。(5) 三个模型的 GMM 软归属都接近硬分配（最大归属 &lt;0.6 的图片 ≤1.3%）。(6) 簇中心检索出的近邻中，主导器官占比在 DINOv3 / EfficientNet 为 90–91%，在 BioCLIP 只有 50%，因为 BioCLIP 的簇不是器官簇。单次划分，每个设置单个种子；标注为描述性的部分只作描述。</p></section><section><h2>复现</h2><pre>cd botanical-computer-vision/meeting_minimal
+<nav><a href=#e1>1</a><a href=#e2>2</a><a href=#e3>3</a><a href=#e4>4</a><a href=#e5>5</a><a href=#e6>6</a><a href=#e7>7</a><a href=#e8>附：三模型</a></nav><section id=e1><h2>1. NSC：性能—保留坐标数曲线</h2><div><span class='b v'>经验证结论</span> <span class='b e'>探索演示</span></div><dl><dt>问什么</dt><dd>用很少的 PCA 坐标能否保持器官区分 / 复现现有聚类分组？</dd><dt>实际做了什么</dt><dd>EfficientNet-B0 原始向量 → PCA-64（仅 train 拟合，白化）。自写 NSC（Tibshirani 2002）；Δ 网格 33 点；train 上按个体 GroupKFold 5 折选 Δ（1-SE 规则），test 只评估一次。任务 A：外部器官标签（BioImages organ_category，7 类）。任务 B：<b>分组近似任务</b>——目标是已有 EfficientNet K=20 cluster ID，与输入同源，具循环性。</dd><dt>结果</dt><dd><div class=tw><table><tr><th>task</th><th>n_train</th><th>n_test</th><th>classes</th><th>delta_1se</th><th>coords_1se</th><th>coords_per_class_1se</th><th>test_F1_delta0</th><th>test_F1_1se</th><th>ratio</th></tr><tr><td>organ (external label)</td><td>1169</td><td>211</td><td>7</td><td>1.500</td><td>22</td><td>7.857</td><td>0.692</td><td>0.672</td><td>0.971</td></tr><tr><td>grouping approximation: own K=20 cluster ID</td><td>1181</td><td>211</td><td>20</td><td>1.250</td><td>61</td><td>21.850</td><td>0.865</td><td>0.853</td><td>0.986</td></tr></table></div><img src='results/exp1_nsc_curve.png' alt='NSC curve'><details><summary>三模型对比：器官任务的准确率—稀疏度曲线</summary><img src='results/exp1b_nsc_3models.png' alt='NSC 3 models'></details><details><summary>EfficientNet 保留的 22 个维度长什么样</summary><p>热图：行是器官，列是 NSC 保留的主方向；红色 = 该器官偏向这个方向的正端，蓝色 = 偏向负端，白色 = 对该器官不重要（被压成 0）。下面每行是一个方向两端各 4 张真实照片。只有前 7 个方向与器官有明显相关（|ρ|≥0.2），其余方向只对个别器官有用，含义需要看照片判断。BioCLIP / DINOv3 在 1-SE Δ 下全部 64 个维度都保留，因此只画曲线、不画热图。方向是数学方向，名称由照片和相关性推断。</p><img src='results/exp1b_nsc_heatmap.png' alt='NSC heatmap'><h4>PC1 · 用于: bark, fruit, inflorescence, leaf, twig, whole tree · − leaf (-0.56) / + whole tree (0.62) · ρ 尺度 -0.65, ρ 亮度 0.33</h4><div class=ends><div><small>− 端</small><div class=strip><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tzaam--lfpetiole-lower35728.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tzaam--lfpetiole-lower35728.jpg' alt='baskauf/35728'></a><figcaption>baskauf/35728<br>Zanthoxylum americanum<br>leaf · close-up</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tpotr5-lfmargin-uplow14027.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tpotr5-lfmargin-uplow14027.jpg' alt='baskauf/14027'></a><figcaption>baskauf/14027<br>Populus tremuloides<br>leaf · close-up</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tcoob9-lfmargin-uplow54683.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tcoob9-lfmargin-uplow54683.jpg' alt='baskauf/54683'></a><figcaption>baskauf/54683<br>Cornus amomum<br>leaf · close-up</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/taial--lfgland15196.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/taial--lfgland15196.jpg' alt='baskauf/15196'></a><figcaption>baskauf/15196<br>Ailanthus altissima<br>leaf · close-up</figcaption></figure></div></div><div><small>+ 端</small><div class=strip><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/t91011.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/t91011.jpg' alt='baskauf/91011'></a><figcaption>baskauf/91011<br>Acer rubrum<br>whole tree · distant</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tprse2-flin-flower10643.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/tprse2-flin-flower10643.jpg' alt='baskauf/10643'></a><figcaption>baskauf/10643<br>Prunus serotina<br>whole tree · distant</figcaption></figure><figure><a href='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/t90975.jpg' target=_blank><img loading=lazy src='https://bioimages.vanderbilt.edu/tn/baskauf/t90975.jpg' alt='baskauf/90975'></a><figcaption>baskauf/90975<br>Ulmus americana<br>whole tr